<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Equinox - 140,000 tonnes coal Bolivar/Rotterdam $6 fio 65,000 shinc/35,000 shinc 10-19/7 Cetragpa.</p>
<p>M.N.Istanbul - 105,000 tonnes coal Hampton Roads/Taranto $6.25 fio 30,000 shinc/30,000 shinc 24/6-3/7 Coe and Clerici.</p>
<p>ORE - U Ming TBN - 140,000 tonnes ore Port Hedland/Constanza $8.55 fio 80,000 shinc/23,000 15-20/7 BHP.</p>
<p>Leon - 105,000 tonnes ore Nouadhibou/Taranto $3.95 fio 30,000 shinc/30,000 shinc 29/6-7/7 Ilva.</p>
